@startuml
class "devices/{id}/command" as CommandController {
  - DeviceCommandService
  + post_device_command(id: str, command: dict)
}

class DeviceCommandService {
  - DeviceRepository
  - DevicePermissionValidator
  - CommandGateway
  - EventPublisher
  + execute_command(user_id: str, device_id: str, command: dict)
  + validate_device_permission(user_id: str, device_id: str)
  + send_command_to_device(device_id: str, command: dict)
  + publish_command_event(device_id: str, command: dict, status: str)
}

class DeviceRepository {
  - DatabaseClient
  + get_device_by_id(device_id: str)
  + get_device_type(device_id: str)
  + update_device_status(device_id: str, status: str)
  + get_user_devices(user_id: str)
}

class DevicePermissionValidator {
  - DeviceRepository
  + validate_user_device_access(user_id: str, device_id: str)
  + validate_command_permission(device_type: str, command: str)
}

class CommandGateway {
  - HTTPDeviceClient
  + send_http_command(device_id: str, command: dict)
  + get_protocol_by_device_type(device_type: str)
}

class EventPublisher {
  - MessageQueueClient
  + publish_command_event(device_id: str, command: dict, status: str)
  + publish_device_status_change(device_id: str, old_status: str, new_status: str)
}

class HTTPDeviceClient {
  - HttpClient
  + send_command(device_url: str, command: dict)
  + get_device_status(device_url: str)
}

class MessageQueueClient {
  - MessageBrokerConfig
  + connect()
  + publish(exchange: str, routing_key: str, message: dict)
  + consume(queue: str, callback: function)
}

CommandController --> DeviceCommandService
DeviceCommandService --> DeviceRepository
DeviceCommandService --> DevicePermissionValidator
DeviceCommandService --> CommandGateway
DeviceCommandService --> EventPublisher
CommandGateway --> HTTPDeviceClient
EventPublisher --> MessageQueueClient
DevicePermissionValidator --> DeviceRepository

note right of CommandController
  REST API Controller
  Валидация входных данных
  Базовая аутентификация
end note

note right of DeviceCommandService
  Бизнес-логика обработки команд
  Валидация прав доступа
  Маршрутизация команд
  Публикация событий
end note

note right of EventPublisher
  Публикация событий в брокер сообщений
end note
@enduml